{"title":"후궁계약","thumbnail":"https://dn-img-page.kakao.com/download/resource?kid=chuZq/hAFPKVnGhS/mn3sZaThkhkaV5c5E13vtK&filename=th3","synopsis":"사신이란 별명으로 불리는 자객 예서는\n어느 날 수상한 남자에게 거액의 비밀 의뢰를 받는다.\n\n\"성국 황제의 후궁으로 입궁해 다오. 그게 내 의뢰이다.\"\n\n뭐야 이거? 자객을 후궁으로 고용해서 뭘 하려고?\n\n\"왜. 존귀하신 황제께서 미녀 자객한테 한번 먹혀보고 싶대?\"\n\"뭐 그쪽도 전혀 흥미가 없는 건 아닌데.\"\n\n……농담이 안 통하는 의뢰인이네.\n\n망설임은 컸지만 거액의 선금을 챙긴 뒤 의뢰를 받았다.\n그런데…… 의뢰인 이 자식? 황제 본인이었어?!\n\n* * * * *\n\n 어쩌다 후궁이 된 인.간.흉.기 예서와\n 진짜 정체야 어찌됐든 두 얼굴의 예서에게 푹 빠진 능력남들의\n 달달쓰 & 살벌쓰한 동양풍 퓨전 로맨스 판타지 ! ! !","topComments":[],"commentKeywords":[],"rankSeries":{"daily":[{"date":"2026-08-09","rank":185,"change":{"type":"down","amount":20}},{"date":"2026-08-10","rank":198,"change":{"type":"down","amount":13}},{"date":"2026-08-11","rank":171,"change":{"type":"up","amount":27}},{"date":"2026-08-12","rank":185,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-13","rank":155,"change":{"type":"up","amount":30}},{"date":"2026-08-14","rank":169,"change":{"type":"down","amount":14}},{"date":"2026-08-15","rank":174,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-16","rank":192,"change":{"type":"down","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-17","rank":175,"change":{"type":"up","amount":17}},{"date":"2026-08-18","rank":221,"change":{"type":"down","amount":46}},{"date":"2026-08-20","rank":244,"change":{"type":"new","amount":null}},{"date":"2026-08-21","rank":199,"change":{"type":"up","amount":45}},{"date":"2026-08-22","rank":181,"change":{"type":"up","amount":18}},{"date":"2026-08-23","rank":182,"change":{"type":"down","amount":1}},{"date":"2026-08-24","rank":206,"change":{"type":"down","amount":24}},{"date":"2026-08-25","rank":211,"change":{"type":"down","amount":5}},{"date":"2026-08-26","rank":219,"change":{"type":"down","amount":8}},{"date":"2026-08-27","rank":206,"change":null},{"date":"2026-08-28","rank":210,"change":{"type":"down","amount":4}},{"date":"2026-08-29","rank":204,"change":{"type":"up","amount":6}},{"date":"2026-08-30","rank":213,"change":{"type":